{"synopsis":"Shin Young-jun, seorang sersan koki, disambut oleh kiamat hanya beberapa hari sebelum liburan. Batalyon tersebut berubah menjadi kekacauan dalam sekejap, dan jaringan komunikasi terputus. Lalu sesuatu muncul di depan matanya! [Selamat atas kebangkitanmu!] [Pekerjaan: Koki Pemula Lv.1] Jika aku seorang pejuang atau pembunuh, aku akan mencoba untuk berdiri sendiri… Yang ditugaskan padanya adalah koki, yang jelas merupakan pekerjaan pendukung . Tidak ada yang bisa dilakukan jika sudah seperti ini. “Mulai sekarang, aku akan memberimu makan.”","alternative_title":"멸망한 세계의 취사병, Myeolmanghan Segyeui Chwisabyeong","author":"웨스트, 마일드커피","artist":"웨스트, 마일드커피","chapters":[{"number":"120","chapter":"120","slug":"f402cf44-176e-4cf7-988b-d32adaf04dc3","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"119","chapter":"119","slug":"40a9d70d-2cab-4daa-a9ab-1cfeb1aa6890","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"118","chapter":"118","slug":"6afc1ffa-708f-4bf4-a98d-85f29f1ff64f","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"117","chapter":"117","slug":"216bb431-953f-4ccf-b52e-83c4564480dc","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"116","chapter":"116","slug":"00ccd9d7-549a-404a-ac27-6567e35786c7","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"115","chapter":"115","slug":"40d2b2b6-3e3e-4eec-bd9b-54b0438364c2","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"114","chapter":"114","slug":"8c9984e8-dfb6-4f6c-a306-3f36996249cb","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"113","chapter":"113","slug":"61d675fc-5b34-4ec7-beb8-2cac03f9f57d","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"112","chapter":"112","slug":"9b740ddb-4e44-44a6-8ddc-07cfb38f9f09","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"111","chapter":"111","slug":"62626971-9276-47c4-9f09-7ae585c5a8fd","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2026-05-25"},{"number":"110","chapter":"110","slug":"ce1c4b71-eafa-4a6c-9705-8145b7c04c3e","title":"Chapter 110","date":